flowchart LR
  U([Usuário / sk]) -->|HTTP| GW[Gateway]
  GW --> R[Receiver]
  R -->|leitura: views v1| DB[(SSOT: schema sum)]
  R -->|requested| REQ[(REQUESTED)]
  REQ --> M[Manager]
  M -->|ligação, Operation, outbox| DB
  DB -->|outbox pendente| P[Publisher]
  P -->|desired| DES[(DESIRED)]
  DES --> REC[Reconciler]
  DES --> OBS[Observer]
  OBSV[(OBSERVED)] --> REC
  OBS -->|observed| OBSV
  REC -->|action| ACT[(ACTION, 4 partições)]
  ACT --> EX[Executor]
  EX -->|completed ou failed| RES[(RESULT)]
  RES --> REC
  RES --> OBS
  OBSV -->|fase e Operation| M
  RES -->|resultado por actionId| M
  EX -->|PROJECT_GRANT_OWNER só em roles-ipm| Z[Zitadel]
  OBS -->|somente leitura| Z
